<td>enter operator's <b>Username</b></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>!FORSALE</td>
<td>enter <b>Availability</b> in this column: put <b>Y</b> for "Available for sale", put <b>N</b> for "Disabled"</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">!MANUFACTURER</td>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;"><b>Distributor</b>: do not create this column or leave it blank</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">!MANUFACTURERID</td>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">enter <b>Distributor ID</b> in this column: it can be found here /admin/manufacturers.php?manufacturerid=<b>DistributorID</b></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">!BRANDID</td>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">enter <b>Brand ID</b> in this column: it can be found here /admin/brands.php?brandid=<b>BrandID</b></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">!CATEGORY</td>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;"><b>Main category</b>: do not create this column or leave it blank</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;"><font color="#e61ab3">!CATEGORYID</font></td>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">enter <b>Main category ID</b> in this column: it can be found here /home.php?cat=<b>MainCategoryID</b></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><font color="#e61ab3">!PRODUCTCODE</font></td>
<td>enter <b>SKU</b> in this column</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>!UPC</td>
<td>enter <b>UPC/EAN/ISBN</b> in this column</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>!PRODUCT</td>
<td>enter <b>Product name</b> in this column</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>!PRODUCT_FROOGLE</td>
<td>enter <b>Product name for Froogle</b> in this column</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>!FULLDESCR</td>
<td>enter <b>Detailed description</b> in this column</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>!DESCR</td>
<td>enter <b>Short description</b> in this column</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">!LIST_PRICE</td>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">enter <b>List price (US$)</b> in this column</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">!COST_TO_US</td>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">enter <b>Cost to us (US$)</b> in this column</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">!PRICE</td>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">enter <b>Price (US$)</b> in this column (Our Price)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>!AVAIL</td>
<td>enter <b>Quantity in stock (items)</b> in this column</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>!LOW_AVAIL_LIMIT</td>
<td>enter <b>Low limit in stock</b> in this column: typically put <b>1</b></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>!MIN_AMOUNT</td>
<td>enter <b>Minimum order quantity</b> in this column</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">!FREE_TAX</td>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">enter <b>Tax exempt</b> in this column: put <b>Y</b> for US distributors, put <b>N</b> for Canadian distributors</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">!TAXES</td>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">enter <b>Apply taxes</b> in this column: leave it blank if no taxes has to be applied, otherwise put <b>HST</b> or <b>GST,HST</b></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>!WEIGHT</td>
<td>enter <b>Weight (lbs)</b> in this column</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>!DIM_X</td>
<td>enter <b>Shipping dimension (inches)</b> #1 in this column</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>!DIM_Y</td>
<td>enter <b>Shipping dimension (inches)</b> #2 in this column</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>!DIM_Z</td>
<td>enter <b>Shipping dimension (inches)</b> #3 in this column</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>!SHIPPING_FREIGHT</td>
<td>enter <b>Shipping freight (US$)</b> in this column</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>!FREE_SHIPPING</td>
<td>enter <b>Free shipping for destination</b> in this column: put <b>N</b> for "No free shipping"</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">!DISCOUNT_SLOPE</td>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">enter <b>Discount slope (%)</b> in this column: typical value: <b>0.4</b></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">!DISCOUNT_TABLE</td>
