</tr>
<tr>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">!DISCOUNT_AVAIL</td>
<td style="background: #eeeeee;">enter <b>Apply global discounts</b> in this column: put <b>Y</b> for "Yes"</td>
</tr>
</table>
